LOCUS       sequence-405841-       10941 bp    DNA     circular SYN 04-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  For inserting a phiC31 attP site. HDR integrant is marked with 
            ie1-DsRed, which is expressed in abdomen and mouthparts. Second U6 
            promoter allows use of two different gRNAs in two synthesized arms..
